Subject: [PATCH] The chapter predicates' readings: timeConstructible_iff,
 spaceConstructible_iff, computesInSpace_iff and seven more
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Each definition gains the lemma that reads it, beside it, by Iff.rfl or rfl (policy.md §1):
Complexity.timeConstructible_iff (ClassP/TimeConstructible); Complexity.spaceConstructible_iff
(SpaceComplexity/Constructible); Turing.FinTM.computesInSpace_iff,
Turing.FinTM.decidesInSpace_iff, Complexity.mem_SPACE_iff, Complexity.logSpace_eq and
Complexity.LOGSPACE_eq (SpaceComplexity/Basic); Complexity.transduce_nil,
Complexity.transduce_cons, and the copying-state lemma Complexity.transduce_of_copy
(ClassNP/Transducer). Additions only; no statement changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
